---

<SiteLayout title="Sell Lemons Evolution Requirements Chart and Guide" description="Use a Sell Lemons evolution requirements chart for reported investors, 42x speed, fruit stages, Void Portal steps, and reset risk.">
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero guide-detail-hero">
      <div class="wrap page-hero__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Reset Planning</p>
          <h1>Sell Lemons Evolution Requirements Chart</h1>
          <p>Use this reported requirements chart to compare fruit stages, investor gates, 42x speed claims, and reset risk before evolving. Every number remains reported or pending until checked in-game.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/sell_lemons_hero_main.png" alt="Sell Lemons evolution guide with speed route planning" width="894" height="500" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="guide-detail">
      <p class="evidence-note">Reported mechanic: players describe evolution as a major speed layer. Treat exact multiplier and requirement numbers as reported or pending unless checked in-game.</p>

      <h2>Sell Lemons Evolution Requirements Chart</h2>
      <div class="route-table">
        {requirementRows.map((row) => (
          <div>
            <strong>{row.evolution} <span class="tag">{row.status}</span></strong>
            <span>{row.fruit}: {row.investors}; {row.speed}; unlock note: {row.unlocks}.</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h2>What Evolution Changes</h2>
      <div class="info-grid">
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">reported</span>
          <h3>Investor requirement</h3>
          <p>Evolution is reported as a reset layer that starts around a large investor gate, with later fruit stages requiring more progress.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">reported</span>
          <h3>Total speed multiplier</h3>
          <p>Community sources describe a 42x Global Speed layer, but this site has not verified the live multiplier.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">reported</span>
          <h3>Reset losses</h3>
          <p>Evolution can reset or consume progress. Treat it as a rebuild decision, not a free upgrade.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <h2>How to Unlock the Void Portal</h2>
      <ol class="mobile-step-list">
        {portalSteps.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
      </ol>

      <h2>What Resets</h2>
      <div class="route-table">
        {resetLosses.map((item) => (
          <div>
            <strong>{item.label} <span class="tag">{item.status}</span></strong>
            <span>{item.value}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h2>When to Evolve</h2>
      <div class="route-table">
        {evolveChecks.map((item) => (
          <div>
            <strong>{item.label} <span class="tag">{item.status}</span></strong>
            <span>{item.value}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h2>When Not to Evolve</h2>
      <div class="info-grid">
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">pending</span>
          <h3>Investor bonus is too low</h3>
          <p>The 200% investor bonus threshold is a community suggestion, not verified rule text.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">reported</span>
          <h3>Managers are not rebuilt quickly</h3>
          <p>If automation takes too long after reset, the 42x speed claim may not help immediately.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <span class="tag">reported</span>
          <h3>You are close to Ascension checks</h3>
          <p>Compare evolution timing against Ascension requirements before burning a strong current route.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <h2>Reset Layer Comparison</h2>
      <div class="route-table">
        {comparisonRows.map((item) => (
          <div>
            <strong>{item.layer}</strong>
            <span>{item.use}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <VideoGuideBlock
        id="evolution-video-guides"
        title="Video Evolution References"
        note="youtube_embed: these videos are visual route examples only. They do not verify the 42x value, investor threshold, or fruit chain requirements."
        videos={youtubeEmbeds}
      />

      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        {faqItems.map((item) => (
          <details class="faq-card">
            <summary>{item.question}</summary>
            <div class="faq-card__body">
              <p>{item.answer}</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h2>Internal Planning Links</h2>
      <div class="mini-table">
        <a href="/profit-calculator/">Calculate upgrade ROI</a>
        <a href="/rebirths/">Review rebirth timing</a>
        <a href="/ascension/">Prepare ascension</a>
        <a href="/money-fast/">Improve cash route speed</a>
      </div>

      <RelatedGuides currentSlug="evolution" />
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
